            "heading": { "type": "heading", "settings": { "text": "You Love Your Pet. The Fur on Your Clothes? Not So Much.", "heading_size": "h2" } },
            "text": { "type": "text", "settings": { "text": "<p>You put on a clean black tee. Your dog gives you that look. You know the fur is already on it. It happens every day—but with Zena Comme, the fit and the feeling help bring that pet parent hair problem down.</p><p>What if your favorite pet tee was made with those moments in mind?</p>" } }
