    "comparison_table_text": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "settings": {
        "text": "<h2>The Smooth-Fabric Difference.</h2><p>Ordinary cotton tees weren't necessarily designed with shedding pets in mind. Ours start with a different priority—everyday wearability in a pet-parent home.</p><table style='width:100%; border-collapse: collapse;'><tr style='border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;'><th style='padding: 10px; text-align:left;'>Feature</th><th style='padding: 10px; text-align:left;'>Zena Comme</th><th style='padding: 10px; text-align:left;'>Ordinary Cotton Tees</th></tr><tr style='border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;'><td style='padding: 10px;'>Personalized pet image</td><td style='padding: 10px;'>Yes</td><td style='padding: 10px;'>Common</td></tr><tr style='border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;'><td style='padding: 10px;'>Smooth pet-hair resistant fabric</td><td style='padding: 10px;'>Designed for this</td><td style='padding: 10px;'>Depends on garment</td></tr><tr style='border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;'><td style='padding: 10px;'>Anti-static fabric design</td><td style='padding: 10px;'>Specialized feature</td><td style='padding: 10px;'>Varies</td></tr></table>"
      }
